{"unit_id":"ArcaneOrion__dsh-model-channel-manager#feature-1","repo":"ArcaneOrion/dsh-model-channel-manager","commit":"bcb5c5a634552e357aa0ae992f3396d19048f2a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Channel Manager 的功能「轮询故障转移」：将渠道组注册为 roundrobin/<组ID> 虚拟路由。发起模型请求时按组策略选择候选，注册的适配器为路由提供服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:9-10","src/index.js:1008-1011"]}
